From: Seyoon Ragavan <complexzetaprime@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:12:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] NTimeHierarchy: the setup's input rewind is
 Build/InputRewind's

The setup's last phase is Turing.inputRewindTM, run through
inputRewindTM_run; the private rewind leaf, its run and the relabeling
collapse are removed, and the seam step collapses its tag through
Cfg.mapState_mapState. No statement changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
